# The API image (Dockerfile) builds from crates/, migrations/, .sqlx/, web/,
# scripts/export-migrations/ (downloads the web app offers) and the workspace
# files: nothing local (build output, dependencies, state,
# secrets) goes into the context.
.git
target
**/node_modules
web/dist
web/dist-perf
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/blob-report
web/playwright/.cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.dev
.superset
deploy
site
docs
**/.DS_Store
